      "en": "As he sat on the Mount of Olives opposite the temple, Peter, James, John, and Andrew asked him privately,",
      "ko": "예수께서 감람산에서 성전을 마주 대하여 앉으셨을 때에 베드로와 야고보와 요한과 안드레가 종용히 묻자오되",
      "source_text_hash": "c74c6b6b6513a821135252f684ec68282f1e3263b840298d3df9f021e5fbe1dd",
      "translation_text_hash": "4039fe8b6db0e279f9e3c9045d05432c6b3a97064ecc6c22a6e2b95eef45f0a0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
