      "en": "Jesus, answering, began to tell them, “Be careful that no one leads you astray.",
      "ko": "예수께서 이르시되 너희가 사람의 미혹을 받지 않도록 주의하라",
      "source_text_hash": "2c76ef09aac0b9a838664948857e4bbdfcf6223e0cae148011b41ae8c60e61a9",
      "translation_text_hash": "7690d285b74bf795117a85afb811e45326f1491c69a25020fa9ab8f08f533016",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "예수께서 이르시되 너희가 사람의 미혹을 받지 않도록 주의하라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7690d285b74bf795117a85afb811e45326f1491c69a25020fa9ab8f08f533016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:MRK:13:6",
      "sequence": 24724,
      "chapter_label": "MRK 13",
