      "en": "For in those days there will be oppression, such as there has not been the like from the beginning of the creation which God created until now, and never will be.",
      "ko": "이는 그날들은 환난의 날이 되겠음이라 하나님의 창조하신 창초부터 지금까지 이런 환난이 없었고 후에도 없으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "815deffc499cfc278c7e25bd3d97a015f6555fa045e6089eccd377323cfe6f2e",
      "translation_text_hash": "104b47e20ff6093fe9c24fa75b80552d0887aed4f215e3d061fa2fd58a686708",
